%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: DwarvenExchangeWithPinky
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551295
    - rid: 268099571011551296
    - rid: 268099571011551297
    - rid: 268099571011551298
    - rid: 268099571011551301
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, Monika. Time to hop off.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, sure.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika does as instructed, giving my arms and back a much needed break.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551302
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought we were heading straight to High Hrothgar-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551303
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Was there something we needed to take care of here first?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You remember how we're lugging around a bunch of scrap metal that we
      got from Alftand?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are we going to do something with it now?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hopefully.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're going to be taking it up to Eorlund, one of the most, perhaps <i>the</i>
      most, famous smiths in all of Skyrim.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And what's Eorlund going to do with it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Either pay us for it, or make us weapons and armor out of it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Both are of pretty good use to us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551305
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551306
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551307
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me, Eorlund-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh hey, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551308
    - rid: 268099571011551309
    - rid: 268099571011551311
    - rid: 268099571011551312
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Natsuki's currently hammering away at some heated metal that seems to
      be in the shape of a hoe.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551313
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: At the sound of my voice, Natuski puts her hammer down and turns toward
      us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, {mc}. Hey, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551315
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You two just checking in or what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sort of, we actually came here for Eorlund.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you learning smithing under him now or what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551316
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll have you know, I'm a pretty good apprentice.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551317
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've already mastered the art of making nails!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551318
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Neat!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551319
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So have you been making <i>just</i> nails up here, or-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551320
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: No, no, I've been doing other stuff too-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice! You're hoe is losing too much heat, you need to dip it back
      in the forge for a bit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551321
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah crap!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Following her master's instructions, Natsuki dips the hoe back into the
      forge, pulling it out when she feels it's malleable enough.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551322
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Natsuki resumes her hammering.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: As you can see, I've also been working on tools and stuff.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551323
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've gotten pretty good at sharpening blades-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, I'm still not entirely sure <i>why</i> we need to press the
      ingot onto the weapon while we do it-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551324
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I already told you, apprentice. It's because we aren't merely sharpening
      the blade, we are <i>tempering</i> it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551325
    - rid: 268099571011551328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: To get the right balance of added durabilty, we need to provide the correct
      weight to offset the sharpening of the blade-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But that doesn't make sense!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551326
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That's what I'm sayin'!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: If we were tempering the blade by adding new material, we would need
      to heat it up properly in the forge to combine the two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The friction from the grindstone shouldn't be enough to heat it up properly
      <i>and</i> just pressing the ingot onto it is really imprecise!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Who's the master of the forge here again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... whatever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551330
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what'd you come here for? Looking to protect yourself, or deal some
      damage?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551331
    - rid: 268099571011551332
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Natsuki, why''d you say <i>those</i> words specifically: "protect myself
      or deal some damage?"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund says it a bunch, like, <i>way</i> too often.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551334
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Why? What's so weird about it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551333
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I lean toward Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551335
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's one of the few lines blacksmiths can say when you open up
      their shop menu in the game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So I was a little worried you were... "acclimating" to your "role."
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh dang.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I still feel like the person I always have been, so I don't think
      I'm "acclimating" or whatever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you <i>sure</i> you feel like the person you always have been?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551337
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What's that supposed to mean?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} have you seriously not noticed?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551339
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Noticed what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Look at the top of her head, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551340
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The top of her head? What's-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551341
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551342
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I take it yesterday didn't go according to plan, Natsuki...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you mean by-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551343
    - rid: 268099571011551344
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It seems she noticed, too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm surprised I didn't notice... especially since werewolves in Skyrim
      don't have their ears showing at all times...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Did something weird happen yesterday?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Those bastards turned me into a werewolf without my consent!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551345
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Seriously?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What happened, exactly?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I tried saying no, but then Skjor told Aela to "show me the power" or
      whatever- '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551346
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Then she grabbed me and slammed me really hard into the basin thing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551347
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: At that point, Kodlak came in and told Aela to put me down, which she
      did-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But some of the werewolf blood got into my mouth when she slammed me,
      so I transformed anyway.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551348
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well... crap!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's... not something that happens in the game. At all...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'If you say no in the game, they just say some dribble that boils down
      to:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: '"You can''t progress through the storyline unless you do this, dummy."'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Since you transformed, did you go feral and go clear out the Silver Hand
      fort with Aela already?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. Aela's still out there doing god knows what.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Tracking down the Silver Hand leadership to kill them, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's what we think she's doing, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... weird.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know how I can get rid of these things?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Some guard tried stopping me before I could enter the city because he
      saw them and assumed I had something to do with the feral pink werewolf running
      around.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551349
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Which was fair enough, I guess. That <i>was</i> me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551350
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Vilkas said I could just get them cut off, but that doesn't sound safe.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551351
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Get rid of just the ears?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551352
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well I can only think of two ways: get them surgically removed like
      Vilkas said, or go cure your lycanthropy.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Like I mentioned before, curing your lycanthropy involves completing
      the questline for the Companions.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Basically, you'll need a reforged Wuuthrad and the head of a Glenmoril
      witch.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Kodlak knows about the Glenmoril witches' location, and the pieces of
      Wuuthrad should mostly be in Silver Hand... hands.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Once you have the both of those, you can run through Ysgramor's tomb,
      which is only accessible by returning Wuuthrad to his statue.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Once you make it to the end, you'll find a big brazier, which you'll
      throw the witch head into.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This will separate your wolf spirit from you, which you'll have to defeat
      in combat.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which is a lot of work...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551353
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you want to get them surgically removed, you should head down to the
      Ratway, and underground section of Riften.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551354
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'About halfway through, there''s a tavern... thing called <i>The Ragged
      Flaggon</i>. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: One of the patrons there is called Galathil, and she's a flesh sculptor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551355
    - rid: 268099571011551356
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: A w-what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's a pretty intimidating name, but she's basically just a magical cosmetic
      surgeon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551357
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure she can use her magic to sculpt more than just a face,
      so she's probably the <i>safest</i> bet for getting them removed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551358
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, since those ears come from a curse, it's possible her magic
      could have no effect.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, her services cost a thousand septims, so you would probably need
      to save up for it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551359
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551360
    - rid: 268099571011551361
    - rid: 268099571011551362
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, no problem.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Weren't we going to do something with the Dwemer scrap, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551363
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Dwemer scrap? What's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551364
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The reason we wanted to see Eorlund. Here, look at this:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551365
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika and I get out all of the scrap metal we collected.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Eorlund glances over from the chainmail he was repairing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Been scavenging Dwemer ruins, eh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: It's been a while since someone asked me to work with that metal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: What're the two of you planning to use it for?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Preferably weapons and armor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye. You got the coin for that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I check how much gold we have...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Absolutely not!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551366
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, but how about working out a deal?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551367
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: A deal?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, we give you all of this scrap, and in return you just make a sword
      for me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That way you'll get some Dwemer metal of your own that you can use however
      you want.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Eorlund takes a moment to think it over.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure. Your sword will be done by tomorrow.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That works for me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Need anything else?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Could I get some more arrows, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551368
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551370
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We invest in getting Monika 20 steel arrows.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551369
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, that should be it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Take care of yourself, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. See you around {mc}, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551371
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Eorlund returns to his chainmail after placing the Dwemer scrap in a
      vat, presumably to be melted by the heat of the forge.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Natsuki resumes working on her hoe.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551372
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ha!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
